# graphify scope for Open Audio Analyzer.
#
# Read by `graphify` on every run, including `--update` and the post-commit
# hook, so the graph is always built from the same corpus. Without this file
# the repository detects as 4,172 files / 6M words, of which 3,787 are
# vendored JUCE.
#
# Patterns are fnmatch, matched against the relative path and against every
# individual path component — so a bare directory name prunes it anywhere.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored dependencies. Not this project's code, and nothing in the graph
# should suggest otherwise: JUCE under plugin/, and miniaudio / pffft /
# dr_libs under engine/. JUCE alone is 3,787 files and carries every one of
# the 84 audio files the detector reports as "video" — its demo assets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build ephemera the detector's own skip list does not already cover.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ephemeral
Pods
.plugin_symlinks

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# graphify's own output, so a second run does not ingest the first one's
# report and wiki as source documents. graphify-out/memory/ is deliberately
# left in — that is where query answers are filed back for the next build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRAPH_REPORT.md
graphify-out/wiki
graphify-out/obsidian

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Images. A scope choice, not noise — delete this block to graph them.
#
# Most of them are generated: every icon under packaging/, android/'s
# mipmaps, the two AppIcon.icon trees, website/public/'s favicons and all of
# assets/brand/ except oaa-logo.svg are written by
# packaging/icon/make_icons.dart from that one drawing, so they carry no
# structure the graph does not already have from the script. The 14 module
# screenshots under website/public/modules do carry something, but each image
# costs its own vision extraction pass.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CMake output. The detector's skip list matches the directory name "build"
# exactly, and this repository's framework-free plugin build lives in
# plugin/build-nojuce/ — 16 files of compiler-probe sources and CTest logs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build-*
CMakeFiles
CMakeCache.txt

# Xcode placeholder, not documentation.
Assets.xcassets
